          </p>
          <div class="ai-scan-chips-row">
            <span class="ai-scan-chip"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i> Otomatik Başlık & Fiyat</span>
            <span class="ai-scan-chip"><i class="fa-solid fa-image"></i> HD Görsel Tespiti</span>
            <span class="ai-scan-chip"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i> Sahte İndirim Filtresi</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Bento Card 2: Profilim & Avcı Merkezi (Step 8) -->
        <div class="feature-bento col-6">
          <div class="feature-icon-badge gold">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-award"></i>
          </div>
          <span
            style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 800; color: #FBBF24; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 8px;">
            AVCI ROZETLERİ & SEVİYE SİSTEMİ
          </span>
